# Traffic Light FSM

## Goal

Learn how to implement a Finite State Machine (FSM) in Verilog by designing a traffic light controller.

## Concepts Learned

- finite state machine (FSM)
- states
- state transitions
- sequential logic
- clock
- reset
- always block
- case statement
- state encoding

## State Diagram

RED

↓

RED + YELLOW

↓

GREEN

↓

YELLOW

↓

RED

## State Table

| Current State | Next State |
|---------------|------------|
| RED           | RED_YELLOW |
| RED_YELLOW    | GREEN      |
| GREEN         | YELLOW     |
| YELLOW        | RED        |

